    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by the Sub Section (4) of Section 27a of the Land Reform Act, No. 01 of 1972 ofthe National State Assembly amended by Land Reform (Special Provisions) Act, No. 39 of 1981, which should be readwith Sub Article (2) of Article 44 of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms do hereby :-",
